      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "\"是吗？",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Is that so?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p01137",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "那就好。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Then that is good.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p01137",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "你一定要好好向方丈道歉。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "You must apologize properly to the abbot.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p01137",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "尽管我已经诚恳地向他赔过不是，但你也要诚心诚意地道歉，求得他的宽恕啊。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Although I have already sincerely apologized to him, you too must apologize with all your heart and ask for his forgiveness.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p01137",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "方丈是一位心胸开阔的人，我想他仍然会收留你的。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "The abbot is a broad-minded man, and I think he will still take you in.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p01137",
      "unit_index": 6,
      "source_text": "不过，这回你再不回心转意，妈妈就死给你看！",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "But this time, if you still do not change your heart, your mother will die before your eyes!",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p01137",
      "unit_index": 7,
      "source_text": "真的，如果你不希望妈妈死，那么你就真心改悔，成为一名了不起的和尚……",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Truly, if you do not want your mother to die, then repent sincerely and become a fine monk...",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p01137",
      "unit_index": 8,
      "source_text": "好了，快快去赔罪吧！\"",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Now, hurry and go apologize!\"",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
